        "original_id": "9aecc697-e693-595e-8739-5c540d38da70",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Siân Gibson, Peter Kay, Johnny Vegas, Nigel Havers, Una Stubbs, Griff Rhys Jones, Nina Wadia, Sheila Reid, Kevin Eldon\n- Works: Peter Kay's Car Share, Murder on the Blackpool Express\n- Awards: BAFTA TV Award for Best Scripted Comedy, National Television Award for Best Comedy\n- Roles: John Redmond, Kayleigh Kitson\n\nFacts:\n- Siân Gibson was born as Siân Foulkes on 15 July 1976 and is a Welsh actress and writer.\n- Siân Gibson is known for collaborations with Peter Kay, including starring in and co-writing the comedy series Peter Kay's Car Share.\n- Siân Gibson won the 2016 BAFTA TV Award for Best Scripted Comedy and the National Television Award for Best Comedy for Peter Kay's Car Share.\n- Peter Kay's Car Share is a British sitcom about supermarket assistant manager John Redmond, played by Peter Kay, and promotions rep Kayleigh Kitson, played by Siân Gibson, taking part in a company car share scheme.\n- Murder on the Blackpool Express stars Johnny Vegas, Siân Gibson, Nigel Havers, Una Stubbs, Griff Rhys Jones, Nina Wadia, Sheila Reid, and Kevin Eldon.",
